# Environment Variables Configuration

# Google Maps API Key for React app (client-side usage)
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
REACT_APP_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Google Maps API Key for Netlify Functions (server-side usage)
# This should be the same key but used in the serverless function
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values with your actual API keys
# 3. Make sure to enable the Distance Matrix API in Google Cloud Console
# 4. (Optional) Set up API key restrictions for security